    |
  1 | #bindgen module c.demo.__bindgen__ {
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `.jet/bindings/c/demo.jet` is written by `jet bind`; hand-written sources use `#extern module`
 Fix: edit your overlay file with `#extern module`, or regenerate the cache with `jet bind`
